">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Mwanzo\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Ahqaf\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/surah/46.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 15\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/46-15.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/46.html\">Sura Al-Ahqaf</a> › Aya 15</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Al-Ahqaf 46:15</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَوَصَّيْنَا الْإِنسَانَ بِوَالِدَيْهِ إِحْسَانًا حَمَلَتْهُ أُمُّهُ كُرْهًا وَوَضَعَتْهُ كُرْهًا وَحَمْلُهُ وَفِصَالُهُ ثَلَاثُونَ شَهْرًا حَتَّىٰ إِذَا بَلَغَ أَشُدَّهُ وَبَلَغَ أَرْبَعِينَ سَنَةً قَالَ رَبِّ أَوْزِعْنِي أَنْ أَشْكُرَ نِعْمَتَكَ الَّتِي أَنْعَمْتَ عَلَيَّ وَعَلَىٰ وَالِدَيَّ وَأَنْ أَعْمَلَ صَالِحًا تَرْضَاهُ وَأَصْلِحْ لِي فِي ذُرِّيَّتِي إِنِّي تُبْتُ إِلَيْكَ وَإِنِّي مِنَ الْمُسْلِمِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Na tumemuusia mwanaadamu awatendee wema wazazi wake wawili. Mama yake amechukua mimba yake kwa taabu, na akamzaa kwa taabu. Na kuchukua mimba kwake hata kumwachisha ziwa ni miezi thalathini. Hata anapo fika utu uzima wake, na akafikilia miaka arubaini, husema: Mola wangu Mlezi! Niwezeshe nishukuru neema zako ulizo nineemesha mimi na wazazi wangu, na nitende mema unayo yapenda. Na unitengenezee dhuriya zangu. Hakika mimi nimetubu kwako, na mimi ni miongoni mwa Waislamu.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وفهم ابن عباس من قوله تعالى: {وحمله وفصاله ثلاثون شهرا} [الأحقاف: 15] مع قوله: {والوالدات يرضعن أولادهن حولين كاملين} [البقرة: 233] أن المرأة قد تلد لستة أشهر<cite>«إعلام الموقعين عن رب العالمين» 1/265</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s46a15\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/46-10.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (46:10)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/46-19.html\">Aya inayofuata (46:19)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/46-19.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Al-Ahqaf 46:19 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Na wote watakuwa na daraja zao mbali mbali kwa waliyo yatenda, na ili awalipe kwa vitendo vyao, na wala hawatadhulumiwa.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/46-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/46-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/46-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/46-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/46-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/46-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/46-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/46-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/46-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/46-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/46-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/46-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/46-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/46-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/46-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/46-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/46-19.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Al-Ahqaf 46:19 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Na wote watakuwa na daraja zao mbali mbali kwa waliyo yatenda, na ili awalipe kwa vitendo vyao, na wala hawatadhulumiwa.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Mwanzo\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Ahqaf\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/surah/46.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 19\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/46-19.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/46.html\">Sura Al-Ahqaf</a> › Aya 19</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Al-Ahqaf 46:19</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَلِكُلٍّ دَرَجَاتٌ مِّمَّا عَمِلُوا وَلِيُوَفِّيَهُمْ أَعْمَالَهُمْ وَهُمْ لَا يُظْلَمُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Na wote watakuwa na daraja zao mbali mbali kwa waliyo yatenda, na ili awalipe kwa vitendo vyao, na wala hawatadhulumiwa.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">أى فى الخير والشر يوفونها ولا يظلمون شيئا من أعمالهم<cite>«طريق الهجرتين وباب السعادتين» 1/419</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فدل ذلك لا محالة أنهم كانوا مأمورين بالشرائع، متعبدين بها فى الدنيا، ولذلك استحقوا الدرجات بأعمالهم فى الآخرة فى الخير والشر،<cite>«طريق الهجرتين وباب السعادتين» 1/419</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s46a19\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/46-15.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (46:15)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/46-26.html\">Aya inayofuata (46:26)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/46-26.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Al-Ahqaf 46:26 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Na bila ya shaka tuliwaweka vizuri sio kama tulivyo kuwekeni nyinyi; na tuliwapa masikio, na macho, na nyoyo. Na hayakuwafaa kitu masikio yao, wala macho y\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/46-26.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/46-26.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/46-26.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/46-26.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/46-26.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/46-26.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/46-26.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/46-26.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/46-26.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/46-26.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/46-26.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/46-26.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/46-26.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/46-26.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/46-26.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/46-26.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/46-26.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Al-Ahqaf 46:26 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Na bila ya shaka tuliwaweka vizuri sio kama tulivyo kuwekeni nyinyi; na tuliwapa masikio, na macho, na nyoyo. Na hayakuwafaa kitu masikio yao, wala macho y\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Mwanzo\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Ahqaf\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/surah/46.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 26\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/46-26.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/46.html\">Sura Al-Ahqaf</a> › Aya 26</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Al-Ahqaf 46:26</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَلَقَدْ مَكَّنَّاهُمْ فِيمَا إِن مَّكَّنَّاكُمْ فِيهِ وَجَعَلْنَا لَهُمْ سَمْعًا وَأَبْصَارًا وَأَفْئِدَةً فَمَا أَغْنَىٰ عَنْهُمْ سَمْعُهُمْ وَلَا أَبْصَارُهُمْ وَلَا أَفْئِدَتُهُم مِّن شَيْءٍ إِذْ كَانُوا يَجْحَدُونَ بِآيَاتِ اللَّهِ وَحَاقَ بِهِم مَّا كَانُوا بِهِ يَسْتَهْزِئُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Na bila ya shaka tuliwaweka vizuri sio kama tulivyo kuwekeni nyinyi; na tuliwapa masikio, na macho, na nyoyo. Na hayakuwafaa kitu masikio yao, wala macho yao, wala nyoyo zao kwa lolote. Kwani hao walikuwa wakizikataa Ishara za Mwenyezi Mungu, na yale waliyo kuwa wakiyafanyia maskhara ndiyo yakawazunguka.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">كيف تجد المعنى أن حكمكم كحكمهم، وأنا إذا كنا قد أهلكناهم بمعصية رسلنا ولم يدفع عنهم ما مكنوا فيه من أسباب العيش فأنتم كذلك<cite>«إعلام الموقعين عن رب العالمين» 1/102</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s46a26\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/46-19.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (46:19)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/46-29.html\">Aya inayofuata (46:29)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/46-29.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Al-Ahqaf 46:29 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Na wakati tulipo waleta kundi la majini kuja kwako kusikiliza Qur&#x27;ani. Basi walipo ihudhuria walisema: Sikilizeni! Na ilipo kwisha somwa, walirudi kwa kaum\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/46-29.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/46-29.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/46-29.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/46-29.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/46-29.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/46-29.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/46-29.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/46-29.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/46-29.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/46-29.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/46-29.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/46-29.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/46-29.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/46-29.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/46-29.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/46-29.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/46-29.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Al-Ahqaf 46:29 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Na wakati tulipo waleta kundi la majini kuja kwako kusikiliza Qur&#x27;ani. Basi walipo ihudhuria walisema: Sikilizeni! Na ilipo kwisha somwa, walirudi kwa kaum\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Mwanzo\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Ahqaf\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/surah/46.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 29\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/46-29.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/46.html\">Sura Al-Ahqaf</a> › Aya 29</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Al-Ahqaf 46:29</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَإِذْ صَرَفْنَا إِلَيْكَ نَفَرًا مِّنَ الْجِنِّ يَسْتَمِعُونَ الْقُرْآنَ فَلَمَّا حَضَرُوهُ قَالُوا أَنصِتُوا فَلَمَّا قُضِيَ وَلَّوْا إِلَىٰ قَوْمِهِم مُّنذِرِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Na wakati tulipo waleta kundi la majini kuja kwako kusikiliza Qur&#x27;ani. Basi walipo ihudhuria walisema: Sikilizeni! Na ilipo kwisha somwa, walirudi kwa kaumu yao kwenda kuwaonya.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Sheikh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فبين أن الذي سمعوه هو القرآن وهو الكتاب.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 12/125</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والله تعالى قد سمى نفس مجموع اللفظ والمعنى قرآنا وكتابا وكلاما<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 12/125</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s46a29\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/46-26.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (46:26)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/46-30.html\">Aya inayofuata (46:30)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/46-30.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta cha